description	"Kao Cen Darach

A legendary Battle Master embodying raw physical might and agility.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 10% Faster Swing Speed
- Lightsaber
-- Single Lightsaber (Yellow/Red/Purple)
-- Dual Lightsabers (Dual/Red/Purple)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- 300% Spec Dmg mult
-- Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]
--- Higher Damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (2)
- Pull (1) 
- Sense (2)
- Protect (1) ^3[CS4]
- Speed (3) ^3[CS3]
- Rage (1)

^8Attributes:
