- Zabrak Strength (1)
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Force Block (2)
- Blast Armor
- Knockdown Roll
- Slow Faller
- Bunny Hop (2)
- Elemental Protection (2)
- Flipkick (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- Aerial Force Regen"